爱的动画角色之一。在剧中，小猪佩奇以其天真烂漫的性格和幽默的生活场景深受观众喜爱。\n\n图片的前景是小猪佩奇手中的银色小勺子和被挖出的红色西瓜瓤；中景是小猪佩奇的身体以及周围的绿色瓜皮和黑色瓜子；背景是一片模糊的绿色植物叶片。整个画面色彩鲜艳明亮，给人一种清新自然的感觉。此外，图片右下角还有几颗散落的棕色瓜子仁，增加了画面的细节感。\n\n总的来说，这是一张充满童趣和欢乐氛围的照片，通过描绘小猪佩奇与西瓜的场景，传达出一种轻松愉快的情绪。同时，由于小猪佩奇的知名度较高，这张照片也可能吸引很多对该角色感兴趣的观众关注。"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":93,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-140,1310],"size":[214.14120483398438,140],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[174]}],"title":"请修改为自己的智谱API key","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline","cnr_id":"was-ns","ver":"f86447721c18758d7b3b6ae5769f52344a3d764a"},"widgets_values":["b26a4c515d6241c9ba9ec8d896980d58.Paxm0khgR4HscAkP",[false,true]],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":102,"type":"ImageConcanate","pos":[1200,350],"size":[210,102],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"图像_1","localized_name":"image1","name":"image1","type":"IMAGE","link":162},{"label":"图像_2","localized_name":"image2","name":"image2","type":"IMAGE","link":161},{"localized_name":"方向","name":"direction","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"direction"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"匹配图像大小","name":"match_image_size","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"match_image_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"图像","localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[163]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImageConcanate","cnr_id":"comfyui-kjnodes","ver":"dafbcae4e6ad1dfbc6bb33d01dc9559e630ecc67","widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["right",true],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":39,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[20,650],"size":[330,60],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae名称","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":0,"links":[76]}],"pr